            "body": "Topic 1 mein hum aasmaan mein the: planets Sun ke gird ellipse mein ghoomte hain, aur Kepler ke niyam batate hain ki kaun kitni der mein ek chakkar lagata hai. Ab hum wapas ek hi grah par utarte hain, aur ek chhota sa sawaal poochte hain: **ek hi Earth par g har jagah ek jaisa 9.8 m/s² hota hai kya?** Class 9 mein hamne g = GM/R² seekha tha aur ye bhi dekha tha ki g Moon par kam hai, poles par thoda zyada hai, aur oopar jaane par kam hota hai. Wahan sirf \"kam hota hai\" kaha tha. Aaj hum **kitna kam** hota hai, wo number nikaalenge: oopar jaane par, neeche (zameen ke andar) jaane par, aur doosre grahon par.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein hum aasmaan mein the: planets Sun ke gird ellipse mein ghoomte hain, aur Kepler ke niyam batate hain ki kaun kitni der mein ek chakkar lagata hai. Ab hum wapas ek hi grah par utarte hain, aur ek chhota sa sawaal poochte hain: **ek hi Earth par g har jagah ek jaisa 9.8 m/s² hota hai kya?** Class 9 mein hamne g = GM/R² seekha tha aur ye bhi dekha tha ki g Moon par kam hai, poles par thoda zyada hai, aur oopar jaane par kam hota hai. Wahan sirf \"kam hota hai\" kaha tha. Aaj hum **kitna kam** hota hai, wo number nikaalenge: oopar jaane par, neeche (zameen ke andar) jaane par, aur doosre grahon par."
