            "headingHinglish": "Tablet par Chaand ka kangaroo",
            "body": "Ravivaar ki shaam thi. Mr. Godbole sofa par baithe chai pi rahe the, aur unka bhatija Yuvraj tablet par ek purana video dekh raha tha: ek astronaut Chaand ki dhool bhari zameen par halke-halke **uchhal-uchhal kar** chal raha tha, jaise koi bada kangaroo ho.\n\n\"Chacha, ye dekho! Ye chal nahi raha, kood raha hai! Aur kitni oonchi!\" Yuvraj hansa. \"Kya ye kam mass ka ho gaya hai?\"\n\nMr. Godbole ne chai ka cup rakha. \"Mass wahi hai, Yuvraj. Suit samet uska mass yahan bhi wahi hota jo Earth par hota. Badla hai **g**. Chaand par g lagbhag 1.6 m/s² hai, Earth ke g ka lagbhag chhathva hissa. Isliye astronaut ka weight bhi lagbhag chhathva hissa reh gaya, aur wohi, kood ke waqt jab zameen chhodta hai, to bahut der tak oopar rehta hai.\"\n\nYuvraj ne sir hilaya, phir tablet ke dusre video par ungli rakhi, jisme International Space Station (ISS) mein ek astronaut hawa mein tair raha tha. \"Aur Chacha, ye jo ISS mein tair rahe hain, wahan to g zero hoga na? Tabhi to kuch gir nahi raha.\"\n\nMr. Godbole muskuraye. \"Ye wahi galatfehmi hai jo bahut logon ko hoti hai. ISS Earth se lagbhag 400 km oopar hai. Ye doori bahut lagti hai, par Earth ki radius 6400 km hai. Chalo, number se dekhte hain ki wahan g kitna hai. Aur ye bhi dekhenge ki agar hum zameen ke **andar** khodte chale jaayein to g badhta hai ya ghat'ta hai, aur Mars aur Jupiter par tumhara weight kya hoga.\"\n\nYuvraj ne tablet band kiya aur kaagaz-pencil utha liya. \"Theek hai Chacha. Pehle number dikhao.\"",
