            "body": "Topic 2 mein dekha ki g kahin bhi ek jaisa nahi rehta: Earth se door jaate jao to g ghat-ta jaata hai, aur Moon ya Mars jaisi jagahon par uski value alag hoti hai. Class 9 mein ye bhi aaya tha ki g kabhi **bilkul zero** nahi hota. Ab ek bada sawal uthta hai. Agar g door jaakar itna kamzor hota jaata hai, to kya hum koi cheez itni **tez** phenk sakte hain ki wo gravity ki pakad se nikal jaaye aur **kabhi wapas na aaye**? Is topic mein hum is sawal ka sahi, number wala jawab dhoondhenge, aur ye bhi dekhenge ki Moon par hawa kyun nahi hai aur Jupiter par kyun hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 2 mein dekha ki g kahin bhi ek jaisa nahi rehta: Earth se door jaate jao to g ghat-ta jaata hai, aur Moon ya Mars jaisi jagahon par uski value alag hoti hai. Class 9 mein ye bhi aaya tha ki g kabhi **bilkul zero** nahi hota. Ab ek bada sawal uthta hai. Agar g door jaakar itna kamzor hota jaata hai, to kya hum koi cheez itni **tez** phenk sakte hain ki wo gravity ki pakad se nikal jaaye aur **kabhi wapas na aaye**? Is topic mein hum is sawal ka sahi, number wala jawab dhoondhenge, aur ye bhi dekhenge ki Moon par hawa kyun nahi hai aur Jupiter par kyun hai."
