            "body": "Topic 3 mein humne dekha ki Earth se **hamesha ke liye** nikalne ke liye lagbhag 11.2 km/s chahiye. Isse kam raftaar par cheez Earth se bandhi rehti hai. Ek satellite bhi aisi hi bandhi hui cheez hai, par ek khaas tareeke se: wo **gir rahi hai aur phir bhi girti nahi**. Class 9 mein humne ye idea Newton ke cannon se samjha tha, aur ek pattern yaad rakha tha: **jitna paas, utna tez aur utna kam time**. Tab kaha gaya tha ki \"poora hisaab aage ki class mein aayega.\" Aaj wo wada poora hoga. Hum ek hi equation se nikaalenge ki satellite kitna tez chalta hai, ek chakkar mein kitna time lagata hai, aur wo ek jagah tika hua kaise dikhta hai.",
