            "headingHinglish": "Countdown aur gubbara",
            "body": "Mr. Naralkar apni bhanji Kalyani ke saath ghar ke drawing room mein television ke saamne baithe the. Screen par Sriharikota ka launch pad dikh raha tha aur neeche ek ghadi ulti ginti kar rahi thi. Kalyani ne apni notebook godi mein rakhi thi aur saans roke baithi thi.\n\n\"... teen, do, ek, **lift-off**!\" Rocket ke neeche se aag aur dhuen ka ek bada gubbaar nikla, aur dheere dheere wo bhaari lamba rocket upar uthne laga, phir tez, aur tez. Kalyani ne taali bajai. Phir uska chehra sochne wala ho gaya.\n\n\"Mama, ek baat samajh nahi aayi. Rocket ke neeche zameen ya hawa ko kaun dhakel raha hai? Wo upar kis cheez ke sahare uth raha hai? Aur jab wo space mein jayega, jahan hawa hai hi nahi, tab?\"\n\nMr. Naralkar muskuraye aur ek gubbara nikaal laaye. \"Is sawaal ka jawab hum abhi banayenge, Kalyani. Aur ye gubbara hamara chhota rocket hoga.\" Unhone gubbara phoolaya aur mooh pakad kar chhod diya: gubbara hawa mein sar-sar karta hua kamre mein idhar se udhar bhaga.\n\n\"Dekha? Isne kis cheez ko dhakela?\" Kalyani ne socha. \"Hawa ko... jo andar se **peeche** nikli.\" \"Bilkul. Ab socho: jis gubbare ke peeche kamre ki hawa thi, kya wo kamre ki hawa ko dhakel raha tha, ya apni hi hawa ko?\" Kalyani ruk gayi. Jawab Class 9 ke ek niyam mein chhupa tha, aur aaj use poora hisaab ke saath dekhna tha.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Naralkar apni bhanji Kalyani ke saath ghar ke drawing room mein television ke saamne baithe the. Screen par Sriharikota ka launch pad dikh raha tha aur neeche ek ghadi ulti ginti kar rahi thi. Kalyani ne apni notebook godi mein rakhi thi aur saans roke baithi thi.\n\n\"... teen, do, ek, **lift-off**!\" Rocket ke neeche se aag aur dhuen ka ek bada gubbaar nikla, aur dheere dheere wo bhaari lamba rocket upar uthne laga, phir tez, aur tez. Kalyani ne taali bajai. Phir uska chehra sochne wala ho gaya.\n\n\"Mama, ek baat samajh nahi aayi. Rocket ke neeche zameen ya hawa ko kaun dhakel raha hai? Wo upar kis cheez ke sahare uth raha hai? Aur jab wo space mein jayega, jahan hawa hai hi nahi, tab?\"\n\nMr. Naralkar muskuraye aur ek gubbara nikaal laaye. \"Is sawaal ka jawab hum abhi banayenge, Kalyani. Aur ye gubbara hamara chhota rocket hoga.\" Unhone gubbara phoolaya aur mooh pakad kar chhod diya: gubbara hawa mein sar-sar karta hua kamre mein idhar se udhar bhaga.\n\n\"Dekha? Isne kis cheez ko dhakela?\" Kalyani ne socha. \"Hawa ko... jo andar se **peeche** nikli.\" \"Bilkul. Ab socho: jis gubbare ke peeche kamre ki hawa thi, kya wo kamre ki hawa ko dhakel raha tha, ya apni hi hawa ko?\" Kalyani ruk gayi. Jawab Class 9 ke ek niyam mein chhupa tha, aur aaj use poora hisaab ke saath dekhna tha."
