            "body": "Topic 2 mein humne baar-baar ek baat maani: **uniform rod ya plank ka weight uske beech mein lagta hai**. Us waqt hume bas ek shart chahiye thi ki weight kisi ek jagah se lagta dikhe, taaki moment nikal sakein. Par sawaal bacha tha: agar rod ek sire par moti ho, ya cheez L-shape ki ho, ya ek khaali ring ho, to wo \"ek jagah\" kahan hogi? Aaj hum us ek point ko dhundhenge: **centre of gravity**.",
