            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 3 mein humne seekha ki kisi bhi cheez ka poora weight ek point, **centre of gravity (CG)**, par kaam karta hua maana ja sakta hai. Ab us point ka asli fayda dekhte hain. Do cheezein dono \"tiki\" hui hain, par ek ko zara sa dhakka do to wo seedhi wapas khadi ho jaati hai, aur doosri dhad se gir padti hai. Farq kahan hai? Jawab **CG kitna oonchaa hai, base kitna chauda hai, aur CG ki seedhi line base ke andar girti hai ya bahar**, isme chhipa hai. Isi se milta hai **stability** ka poora hisaab."
