            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne seekha ki accha fuel kaise parakhte hain: calorific value (kJ/kg), store aur transport mein aasaani, daam, safety aur pollution; aur strot ko renewable ya non-renewable mein kaise baantte hain. Ab chapter ka sabse bada non-renewable strot andar se dekhte hain: **fossil fuels**. Class 9 mein ([work-energy-and-power-part3.md](../../../class9/physics/work-energy-and-power/work-energy-and-power-part3.md)) humne itna jaana tha ki koyla, petrol aur diesel purane paudhon-janwaron se bane hain, aur wahan likha tha ki inki poori kahani Class 10 mein hai. Wahi kahani ab shuru hoti hai: ye kaise bane, inse bijli kaise banti hai, kitni energy raaste mein kho jaati hai, aur iski keemat hawa aur zameen kaise chukati hain.",
