            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Fossil fuel** | Karodon saal pehle ke mare hue paudhon aur chhote jeevon se zameen ke neeche bana fuel | Coal, petroleum, natural gas |\n| **Crude oil (kachcha tel)** | Zameen se nikla hua gaadha, kaala-sa, bina saaf kiya petroleum | Refinery ko jaane se pehle ka tel |\n| **Natural gas** | Zameen ke neeche mili gas jo zyaadatar methane hoti hai | CNG ka source |\n| **Thermal power plant** | Wo plant jahan fuel jala kar garmi se bhaap banti hai aur bhaap se bijli | Koyle wala bijlighar |\n| **Boiler** | Bada bhatti jaisa dhaancha jahan fuel jalta hai aur paani bhaap ban jaata hai | Plant ka sabse garam hissa |\n| **Turbine** | Pankhudiyon wala pahiya jo bhaap ke dhakke se tez ghoomta hai | Pinwheel ya chakri, par bahut bada |\n| **Generator** | Machine jo ghoomti hui shaft ki energy ko bijli mein badalti hai | Turbine ke saath juda hua |\n| **Condenser** | Wo hissa jahan istemaal ki hui bhaap thandi hokar wapas paani ban jaati hai | Turbine ke baad |\n| **Cooling tower** | Bada tower jo condenser ka garam paani hawa aur vaashpan se thanda karta hai | Safed baadal wale gol tower |\n| **Fly ash** | Koyle ki nahi jalne wali mitti-patthar jaisi baareek raakh jo gas ke saath udti hai | Chimney ke filter mein jamti hai |\n| **Reserves (bhandar)** | Zameen ke neeche abhi bacha, nikaalne laayak fuel | Kisi coalfield ka bacha koyla |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Fossil fuel** | Karodon saal pehle ke mare hue paudhon aur chhote jeevon se zameen ke neeche bana fuel | Coal, petroleum, natural gas |\n| **Crude oil (kachcha tel)** | Zameen se nikla hua gaadha, kaala-sa, bina saaf kiya petroleum | Refinery ko jaane se pehle ka tel |\n| **Natural gas** | Zameen ke neeche mili gas jo zyaadatar methane hoti hai | CNG ka source |\n| **Thermal power plant** | Wo plant jahan fuel jala kar garmi se bhaap banti hai aur bhaap se bijli | Koyle wala bijlighar |\n| **Boiler** | Bada bhatti jaisa dhaancha jahan fuel jalta hai aur paani bhaap ban jaata hai | Plant ka sabse garam hissa |\n| **Turbine** | Pankhudiyon wala pahiya jo bhaap ke dhakke se tez ghoomta hai | Pinwheel ya chakri, par bahut bada |\n| **Generator** | Machine jo ghoomti hui shaft ki energy ko bijli mein badalti hai | Turbine ke saath juda hua |\n| **Condenser** | Wo hissa jahan istemaal ki hui bhaap thandi hokar wapas paani ban jaati hai | Turbine ke baad |\n| **Cooling tower** | Bada tower jo condenser ka garam paani hawa aur vaashpan se thanda karta hai | Safed baadal wale gol tower |\n| **Fly ash** | Koyle ki nahi jalne wali mitti-patthar jaisi baareek raakh jo gas ke saath udti hai | Chimney ke filter mein jamti hai |\n| **Reserves (bhandar)** | Zameen ke neeche abhi bacha, nikaalne laayak fuel | Kisi coalfield ka bacha koyla |"
