            "body": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki thermal power plant mein koyla jalta hai, paani bhaap banta hai, bhaap **turbine** ghumati hai aur turbine se jude **generator** se bijli milti hai. Is poori kahani mein sabse bhaari cheez thi **jalta hua eendhan**: wo mehenga bhi hai aur dhuan bhi chhodta hai. Ab ek seedha sawaal: turbine ko ghumane ke liye bhaap hi kyun? Agar koi cheez pehle se hi **chal rahi** ho, jaise girta hua paani, behti hawa ya samundar ki tide, to usse turbine seedha ghumaya ja sakta hai. Na koyla, na boiler. Is topic mein hum ye teen strot dekhenge, aur har ek ka **hisaab** bhi lagayenge: kitni power milegi, aur kis cheez par wo nirbhar karti hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Pichhle topic mein humne dekha ki thermal power plant mein koyla jalta hai, paani bhaap banta hai, bhaap **turbine** ghumati hai aur turbine se jude **generator** se bijli milti hai. Is poori kahani mein sabse bhaari cheez thi **jalta hua eendhan**: wo mehenga bhi hai aur dhuan bhi chhodta hai. Ab ek seedha sawaal: turbine ko ghumane ke liye bhaap hi kyun? Agar koi cheez pehle se hi **chal rahi** ho, jaise girta hua paani, behti hawa ya samundar ki tide, to usse turbine seedha ghumaya ja sakta hai. Na koyla, na boiler. Is topic mein hum ye teen strot dekhenge, aur har ek ka **hisaab** bhi lagayenge: kitni power milegi, aur kis cheez par wo nirbhar karti hai."
