            "heading": "Chhat par panel aur ulta chalta meter",
            "headingHinglish": "Chhat par panel aur ulta chalta meter",
            "body": "Mr. Ghanekar ki chhat par subah se drill aur hathode ki awaaz aa rahi thi. Do technician aluminium ke frame par **8 solar panels** kas rahe the, har panel lagbhag 1.6 m² ka, sab dakshin ki taraf jhuke hue. Mr. Ghanekar ka bhanja Kanishk chhutti mein aaya hua tha, aur wo har kaam ko dhyan se dekh raha tha. Taar neeche ek dabbe (inverter) se hote hue ghar ke board tak aaye aur passage mein ek naya meter lag gaya. Technician ne seedha kaha: \"Taaron aur dabbe ko haath mat lagana, ye hamara kaam hai.\"\n\nDopahar ki tez dhoop mein jaise hi switch on hua, Kanishk meter ke saamne khada tha ki achanak chillaya, \"Mama! Meter **ulta** chal raha hai!\"\n\nMr. Ghanekar hanse. \"Ghar mein abhi sirf ek pankha aur fridge chal rahe hain. Panel un se **zyada** bijli bana rahe hain, to bachi hui bijli bijli-company ki line mein chali jaati hai aur meter use gin leta hai. Purane meter ki dial sach mein ulti ghoomti thi. Naye **net meter** mein 'import' aur 'export' alag ginte hain, par matlab wahi hai.\"\n\nKanishk ka sawal tayyar tha. \"Par Mama, na koi dhuan, na engine, na koi paani. Bas ek kaanch jaisa chapta dabba. Isme se bijli aati kahan se hai? Aur kal baarish hui to?\" Mr. Ghanekar ne chhat ke kone mein rakhe ek purane **solar cooker** ki taraf ishaara kiya. \"Wo bhi dhoop se chalta hai. To kya wo bhi bijli banata hai?\" Kanishk ne socha. \"Hmm... shayad. Dono kaale hain, dono par kaanch laga hai.\" Mr. Ghanekar muskuraye. \"Wahi ek galat-fehmi hai jo aaj saaf karni hai. Chalo, Suraj se shuru karte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Ghanekar ki chhat par subah se drill aur hathode ki awaaz aa rahi thi. Do technician aluminium ke frame par **8 solar panels** kas rahe the, har panel lagbhag 1.6 m² ka, sab dakshin ki taraf jhuke hue. Mr. Ghanekar ka bhanja Kanishk chhutti mein aaya hua tha, aur wo har kaam ko dhyan se dekh raha tha. Taar neeche ek dabbe (inverter) se hote hue ghar ke board tak aaye aur passage mein ek naya meter lag gaya. Technician ne seedha kaha: \"Taaron aur dabbe ko haath mat lagana, ye hamara kaam hai.\"\n\nDopahar ki tez dhoop mein jaise hi switch on hua, Kanishk meter ke saamne khada tha ki achanak chillaya, \"Mama! Meter **ulta** chal raha hai!\"\n\nMr. Ghanekar hanse. \"Ghar mein abhi sirf ek pankha aur fridge chal rahe hain. Panel un se **zyada** bijli bana rahe hain, to bachi hui bijli bijli-company ki line mein chali jaati hai aur meter use gin leta hai. Purane meter ki dial sach mein ulti ghoomti thi. Naye **net meter** mein 'import' aur 'export' alag ginte hain, par matlab wahi hai.\"\n\nKanishk ka sawal tayyar tha. \"Par Mama, na koi dhuan, na engine, na koi paani. Bas ek kaanch jaisa chapta dabba. Isme se bijli aati kahan se hai? Aur kal baarish hui to?\" Mr. Ghanekar ne chhat ke kone mein rakhe ek purane **solar cooker** ki taraf ishaara kiya. \"Wo bhi dhoop se chalta hai. To kya wo bhi bijli banata hai?\" Kanishk ne socha. \"Hmm... shayad. Dono kaale hain, dono par kaanch laga hai.\" Mr. Ghanekar muskuraye. \"Wahi ek galat-fehmi hai jo aaj saaf karni hai. Chalo, Suraj se shuru karte hain.\""
