            "headingHinglish": "Almaari se nikla purana camera",
            "body": "Mr. Palande ne nani ke zamane ki almaari ka sabse neeche wala khana kholna shuru kiya, aur kapde mein lipta ek purana **film camera** nikla. Unki bhanji Sampada chhutti mein aayi hui thi, aur uske haath mein school ki copy khuli thi jisme aankh ka naksha bana tha.\n\nMr. Palande ne camera ka lens ghumakar kholkar andar jhaanka. \"Ye dekh Sampada. Ye gol chhed **aperture** hai, roshni isi se andar aati hai. Ye parda **shutter** hai, click karte hi thodi der ke liye khulta hai. Aur sabse peeche **film**: tasveer yahin banti hai.\"\n\nSampada ne apni copy ke naksha par ungli rakhi. \"Mama, ye to meri copy ka aankh jaisa hai! Pupil aperture hai, retina film hai. Par shutter kaun hai? Aur ek baat aur: camera mein focus karne ke liye lens ko aage-peeche ghumate hain. Meri aankh ka lens to kahin ghumta nahi. Phir focus kaise hota hai?\"\n\n\"Achha sawaal,\" Mr. Palande hanse. Sampada ne ek aur poochha: \"Class 9 mein padha tha ki cornea sabse zyada bending karta hai aur lens bas thoda sa. Par 'zyada' aur 'thoda' kitna? Kya iska koi number hai?\"\n\nMr. Palande ne camera mez par rakha. \"Number hai, Sampada, aur nikalna bhi aata hai. Kyunki aankh ek **asli lens system** hai, aur lens ka hisaab hum dioptre mein kar sakte hain. Chal, aankh ko camera ki tarah khol kar dekhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Palande ne nani ke zamane ki almaari ka sabse neeche wala khana kholna shuru kiya, aur kapde mein lipta ek purana **film camera** nikla. Unki bhanji Sampada chhutti mein aayi hui thi, aur uske haath mein school ki copy khuli thi jisme aankh ka naksha bana tha.\n\nMr. Palande ne camera ka lens ghumakar kholkar andar jhaanka. \"Ye dekh Sampada. Ye gol chhed **aperture** hai, roshni isi se andar aati hai. Ye parda **shutter** hai, click karte hi thodi der ke liye khulta hai. Aur sabse peeche **film**: tasveer yahin banti hai.\"\n\nSampada ne apni copy ke naksha par ungli rakhi. \"Mama, ye to meri copy ka aankh jaisa hai! Pupil aperture hai, retina film hai. Par shutter kaun hai? Aur ek baat aur: camera mein focus karne ke liye lens ko aage-peeche ghumate hain. Meri aankh ka lens to kahin ghumta nahi. Phir focus kaise hota hai?\"\n\n\"Achha sawaal,\" Mr. Palande hanse. Sampada ne ek aur poochha: \"Class 9 mein padha tha ki cornea sabse zyada bending karta hai aur lens bas thoda sa. Par 'zyada' aur 'thoda' kitna? Kya iska koi number hai?\"\n\nMr. Palande ne camera mez par rakha. \"Number hai, Sampada, aur nikalna bhi aata hai. Kyunki aankh ek **asli lens system** hai, aur lens ka hisaab hum dioptre mein kar sakte hain. Chal, aankh ko camera ki tarah khol kar dekhte hain.\""
