            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Aperture** | Wo gol chhed jisse roshni andar aati hai; chhed jitna bada, roshni utni zyada | Camera ka chhed, aankh ka pupil |\n| **Shutter** | Wo parda ya dhakkan jo tay karta hai ki roshni kitni der andar aaye | Camera ka click |\n| **Film ya sensor** | Wo sateh jahan image ka record banta hai | Camera ki film, aankh ka retina |\n| **Effective power** | Lens formula ko aise lagane se mili power jaise aankh ke andar hawa ho: ek kaam chalau, lagbhag sahi number | Poori aankh ki lagbhag +60 D |\n| **Accommodation power (D mein)** | Paas dekhne ke liye eye lens apni power mein jitni extra power jodta hai | Jawan aankh mein lagbhag +4 D |\n| **Dark adaptation** | Andhere mein aankh ka dheere dheere halki roshni ke liye taiyaar ho jaana | Andheri cinema hall mein baithne ke kuch minute baad |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Aperture** | Wo gol chhed jisse roshni andar aati hai; chhed jitna bada, roshni utni zyada | Camera ka chhed, aankh ka pupil |\n| **Shutter** | Wo parda ya dhakkan jo tay karta hai ki roshni kitni der andar aaye | Camera ka click |\n| **Film ya sensor** | Wo sateh jahan image ka record banta hai | Camera ki film, aankh ka retina |\n| **Effective power** | Lens formula ko aise lagane se mili power jaise aankh ke andar hawa ho: ek kaam chalau, lagbhag sahi number | Poori aankh ki lagbhag +60 D |\n| **Accommodation power (D mein)** | Paas dekhne ke liye eye lens apni power mein jitni extra power jodta hai | Jawan aankh mein lagbhag +4 D |\n| **Dark adaptation** | Andhere mein aankh ka dheere dheere halki roshni ke liye taiyaar ho jaana | Andheri cinema hall mein baithne ke kuch minute baad |"
