            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne aankh ko ek asli lens system ki tarah dekha: lagbhag +60 D ki kul power, jawan aankh ki lagbhag +4 D ki accommodation, aur ek retina jo lens se lagbhag 2.3 cm peeche hai. Ab sawaal ye hai ki jab ye hisaab thoda bigad jaye, to chashme ka number **kaise nikalta hai**, aur parchi par likha \"−2.50\" ya \"+1.75\" asal mein kehta kya hai? Is topic mein hum number ke peeche ka hisaab seekhenge: ek aankh ki takleef se seedha lens ki power tak.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne aankh ko ek asli lens system ki tarah dekha: lagbhag +60 D ki kul power, jawan aankh ki lagbhag +4 D ki accommodation, aur ek retina jo lens se lagbhag 2.3 cm peeche hai. Ab sawaal ye hai ki jab ye hisaab thoda bigad jaye, to chashme ka number **kaise nikalta hai**, aur parchi par likha \"−2.50\" ya \"+1.75\" asal mein kehta kya hai? Is topic mein hum number ke peeche ka hisaab seekhenge: ek aankh ki takleef se seedha lens ki power tak."
