            "body": "Mr. Tambat ki purani wristwatch ruk gayi thi, to unka bhanja Aniruddh unke saath gali ke mod par ek ghadi-saaz ki chhoti si dukaan mein gaya. Ghadi-saaz ne ghadi ka piche ka dhakkan kholkar mez par rakha, aur apni **ek aankh ke aage ek chhota gol kaanch (loupe)** lagaya. Andar ke gear itne chhote the ki Aniruddh ko sirf dhundhli si chamak dikhi.\n\nAniruddh ne jhuk kar ghadi ko apni aankh ke bilkul paas, lagbhag 5 cm door, le aane ki koshish ki. Ulta ho gaya: gear **aur bhi dhundhle**. Phir ghadi-saaz ne usse loupe diya. Loupe aankh ke paas rakhte hi gears ke daant **saaf, bade aur chamakdaar** dikhne lage.\n\n\"Mama, ye kaise? Aankh ko paas le jaane se to dhundhla hua, par ek chhote se kaanch ke saath saaf ho gaya!\" Mr. Tambat ne hanste hue kaha, \"Kal tumhari school lab mein microscope hai na? Wahan ek ki jagah **do** lens milenge. Dono sawaal ek hi jawab se jude hain.\"\n\nAgle din lab mein teacher ne pyaaz ke chhilke ki ek patli parat slide par rakhi. Microscope mein dekhte hi Aniruddh chilla utha: ek ek **cell** gin sakta tha, jaise chhoti-chhoti eent ki deewar! Par ek baat ajeeb thi: slide ko **left** sarkao to cells **right** bhaagte dikhte the.\n\nDo sawaal bache: **loupe aankh ko paas laane par bhi saaf kaise dikhata hai? Aur microscope mein do lens kyun, aur picture ulti kyun?** Dono sawaal hum Part A se C ke baad \"Wapas dukaan par aur lab mein\" section mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Tambat ki purani wristwatch ruk gayi thi, to unka bhanja Aniruddh unke saath gali ke mod par ek ghadi-saaz ki chhoti si dukaan mein gaya. Ghadi-saaz ne ghadi ka piche ka dhakkan kholkar mez par rakha, aur apni **ek aankh ke aage ek chhota gol kaanch (loupe)** lagaya. Andar ke gear itne chhote the ki Aniruddh ko sirf dhundhli si chamak dikhi.\n\nAniruddh ne jhuk kar ghadi ko apni aankh ke bilkul paas, lagbhag 5 cm door, le aane ki koshish ki. Ulta ho gaya: gear **aur bhi dhundhle**. Phir ghadi-saaz ne usse loupe diya. Loupe aankh ke paas rakhte hi gears ke daant **saaf, bade aur chamakdaar** dikhne lage.\n\n\"Mama, ye kaise? Aankh ko paas le jaane se to dhundhla hua, par ek chhote se kaanch ke saath saaf ho gaya!\" Mr. Tambat ne hanste hue kaha, \"Kal tumhari school lab mein microscope hai na? Wahan ek ki jagah **do** lens milenge. Dono sawaal ek hi jawab se jude hain.\"\n\nAgle din lab mein teacher ne pyaaz ke chhilke ki ek patli parat slide par rakhi. Microscope mein dekhte hi Aniruddh chilla utha: ek ek **cell** gin sakta tha, jaise chhoti-chhoti eent ki deewar! Par ek baat ajeeb thi: slide ko **left** sarkao to cells **right** bhaagte dikhte the.\n\nDo sawaal bache: **loupe aankh ko paas laane par bhi saaf kaise dikhata hai? Aur microscope mein do lens kyun, aur picture ulti kyun?** Dono sawaal hum Part A se C ke baad \"Wapas dukaan par aur lab mein\" section mein solve karenge."
