            "body": "**Loupe ka raaz:** ghadi-saaz ne cheez (gear) ko loupe ke F₁ (f = 2.5 cm) ke thik paas, **lagbhag 2.5 cm par** rakha. Cheez aankh ke itne paas thi ki **bina loupe ke** dhundhli hoti (Part A: 25 cm se paas aankh focus nahi kar sakti), par loupe ne image ko door (D ya infinity) banaya, isliye aankh ko aaram se saaf dikhi. Aniruddh jab ghadi ko 5 cm par laya, to aankh ko zaroori extra power 1 ÷ 0.05 m = 20 D thi, jabki wo sirf lagbhag +4 D de sakti hai. Isliye dhundhla.\n\n**Lab ka raaz:** microscope mein 2 stage hain. Objective 10 guna badi real image banata hai, eyepiece usse 11 guna aur: total 110 (Example 4). Picture ulti isliye ki objective ki image ulti hai.",
