            "correctIndex": 1,
            "explanation": "d = 10 cm = 0.10 m. Zaroori extra power = 1 ÷ d = 1 ÷ 0.10 m = 10 D. Aankh sirf +4 D de sakti hai, so no: 10 D > 4 D, gear dhundhla. Sabse paas d = 1 ÷ 4 D = 0.25 m = 25 cm. Check: 1 ÷ 10 D = 0.1 m ✅, 10 D − 4 D = 6 D ki deficit ✅"
