            "heading": "Class 9 ka recall",
            "headingHinglish": "Class 9 ka recall",
            "body": "Class 9 ([light-refraction-part7.md](../../../class9/physics/light-refraction/light-refraction-part7.md), Part H) mein aankhon ki dekhbhaal ke paanch tareeke aur 20-20-20 rule aaye the. Wahin sign convention aur formulas (1/v − 1/u = 1/f, m = v ÷ u, P = 1 ÷ f) [light-refraction-part6.md](../../../class9/physics/light-refraction/light-refraction-part6.md) mein hain. Hum unhe dohrate nahi, unke peeche ka **hisaab** dekhte hain.\n\n**Sign convention (Class 9 wala, hum yahi lenge):** light left se right ko jaati hai. Real object ke liye u negative. Convex lens ka f positive, concave ka negative. Virtual image (object ki hi taraf) ka v negative, real image (doosri taraf) ka v positive.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 9 ([light-refraction-part7.md](../../../class9/physics/light-refraction/light-refraction-part7.md), Part H) mein aankhon ki dekhbhaal ke paanch tareeke aur 20-20-20 rule aaye the. Wahin sign convention aur formulas (1/v − 1/u = 1/f, m = v ÷ u, P = 1 ÷ f) [light-refraction-part6.md](../../../class9/physics/light-refraction/light-refraction-part6.md) mein hain. Hum unhe dohrate nahi, unke peeche ka **hisaab** dekhte hain.\n\n**Sign convention (Class 9 wala, hum yahi lenge):** light left se right ko jaati hai. Real object ke liye u negative. Convex lens ka f positive, concave ka negative. Virtual image (object ki hi taraf) ka v negative, real image (doosri taraf) ka v positive."
