            "body": "| Topic | Kya seekha | Ek line |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1. Aankh ek asli lens system | Aankh ke numbers, accommodation, pupil, rods aur cones | Cornea lagbhag +40 D, lens lagbhag +20 D, kul lagbhag +60 D; retina lagbhag 2.3 cm door; jawan accommodation lagbhag +4 D, near point = 1 ÷ A; pupil ka area d² ke saath; retina par image real aur ulti |\n| 2. Myopia aur hypermetropia | Chashme ka number | Myopia mein f = − far point (concave); hypermetropia mein u = −25 cm, v = − near point (convex); prescription nearest 0.25 D; chashma lagbhag 1.5 se 2 cm aage hone se number thoda alag (jaise −3.25 D contact, −3.50 D chashma) |\n| 3. Presbyopia, astigmatism, cataract | Umar ke dosh | Accommodation lagbhag +4 D se lagbhag +1 D (50 se 60 saal); reading add convex; bifocal aur progressive; astigmatism mein cylindrical lens; cataract mein IOL |\n| 4. Magnifying glass aur microscope | Chhoti cheez badi | M = 1 + D ÷ f (image D par), M = D ÷ f (image infinity par); loupe real image nahi, virtual banata hai; compound microscope M = m_o × m_e (jaise −10 × +11 = −110) |\n| 5. Telescope aur camera | Door ki cheez paas | Objective lambi f, eyepiece chhoti f; M = f_o ÷ f_e, length f_o + f_e; image ulti; reflecting telescope mein concave mirror; camera mein lens, aperture, shutter, sensor; telescope ka kaam roshni ikatthi karna aur kon bada karna, sirf \"bada\" nahi |\n| 6. Sab kuch mila kar | Dekhbhaal aur formula chart | 20-20-20 (6 m par lagbhag 0.17 D), padhne ki doori 30 se 40 cm, Suraj ya laser kabhi nahi; P = 1 ÷ f (f metre mein), u negative, retina par ulti image, telescope aur microscope alag |\n\nAankh ke asli numbers se leke telescope ke kon tak, tumne ek poora safar tay kiya. Ab aankh aur roshni ka ek aur rahasya baaki hai.\n\n**Aage kya?** Class 10 Physics Chapter 5 Atmospheric Refraction, Scattering and the Spectrum: taare jhilmilate kyun hain par grah kyun nahi, aur violet ke aage aur laal ke neeche kya hai.",
