            "body": "Garmi ki chhutti thi. Mr. Dhavale apni bhatiji Shalmali ke saath society ki terrace par chatai bichhakar leta hua tha. Bijli gayi hui thi, to aasmaan ek dum saaf tha. Shalmali ne dekha ki zyaadatar taare **jhilmil-jhilmil** kar rahe hain: kabhi tez, kabhi dheeme, kabhi lagta hai jaise kaanp rahe hon.\n\n\"Chacha, ye taare itna hilte kyun hain? Kya wahan koi baar-baar light on-off kar raha hai?\" Mr. Dhavale hans pade, \"Pehle ek kaam karo. Ye dekho.\" Unhone ek bahut tez chamakta bindu dikhaya, jo seedha jala hua tha, zara bhi nahi jhilmila raha tha. \"Ye bhi to taare jaisa dikhta hai, par hilta nahi!\" Phone ke sky app ne bataya ki wo ek **grah (planet)** hai.\n\n\"Dono chhote bindu jaise dikhte hain, phir ek jhilmilata hai aur doosra nahi?\" Shalmali ne soch mein sir khujaya. Phir usne apna doosra sawaal poocha: \"Aur kal subah mummy ne kaha ki Sooraj ka time table mein 6:12 likha hai, par maine to 6:10 par hi dekh liya!\" Mr. Dhavale ne muskura kar kaha, \"Teeno sawaalon ka jawab ek hi hai: **hawa**. Chalo dhire dhire dekhte hain.\"\n\nTeen sawaal: **taara jhilmilata kyun hai, grah kyun nahi, aur sooraj time se pehle kaise dikh gaya?** Aakhir mein hum \"Wapas terrace par\" section mein teeno solve karenge.",
