            "headingHinglish": "Train ki khidki: laal shaam, neela dopahar",
            "body": "Mr. Khopkar apne bhanje Gandhar ke saath ek train mein maidani ilaake se guzar rahe the. Shaam ke lagbhag saade chhe baje the. Khidki ke bahar door tak khet the, aur kshitij par Sooraj ek **bada, narangi-laal gola** ban kar latak raha tha. Uske aaspaas aasmaan peela-narangi, aur upar ki taraf gehra neela.\n\n\"Mama, dopahar ko to Sooraj safed-peela chamakta hai, ab laal kyun?\" Gandhar ne poocha. Phir wo khud hi bola, \"Aur kal subah station par aasmaan kitna neela tha! Aasmaan ko kisne rang kiya hai?\"\n\nMr. Khopkar hanse. \"Class 9 mein padha tha na ki Sooraj ki roshni mein saare rang mile hote hain? To agar aasmaan mein koi rang nahi dala gaya, to neela kahan se aaya? Aur agar hawa neeli hai, to Sooraj ke saamne wali hawa laal kyun nahi?\" Agle din dopahar ko jab train ek chhote station par ruki, Gandhar ne dekha ki aasmaan gehra neela hai, aur ek chhota badal bilkul **safed** hai: na neela, na laal.\n\nTeen sawaal bache: **aasmaan neela kyun? Sooraj shaam ko laal kyun? Aur badal safed kyun?** Teeno ka jawab ek hi shabd mein hai: **scattering**. Ye teeno sawaal hum Part A se E ke baad \"Wapas train mein\" section mein solve karenge.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Khopkar apne bhanje Gandhar ke saath ek train mein maidani ilaake se guzar rahe the. Shaam ke lagbhag saade chhe baje the. Khidki ke bahar door tak khet the, aur kshitij par Sooraj ek **bada, narangi-laal gola** ban kar latak raha tha. Uske aaspaas aasmaan peela-narangi, aur upar ki taraf gehra neela.\n\n\"Mama, dopahar ko to Sooraj safed-peela chamakta hai, ab laal kyun?\" Gandhar ne poocha. Phir wo khud hi bola, \"Aur kal subah station par aasmaan kitna neela tha! Aasmaan ko kisne rang kiya hai?\"\n\nMr. Khopkar hanse. \"Class 9 mein padha tha na ki Sooraj ki roshni mein saare rang mile hote hain? To agar aasmaan mein koi rang nahi dala gaya, to neela kahan se aaya? Aur agar hawa neeli hai, to Sooraj ke saamne wali hawa laal kyun nahi?\" Agle din dopahar ko jab train ek chhote station par ruki, Gandhar ne dekha ki aasmaan gehra neela hai, aur ek chhota badal bilkul **safed** hai: na neela, na laal.\n\nTeen sawaal bache: **aasmaan neela kyun? Sooraj shaam ko laal kyun? Aur badal safed kyun?** Teeno ka jawab ek hi shabd mein hai: **scattering**. Ye teeno sawaal hum Part A se E ke baad \"Wapas train mein\" section mein solve karenge."
