            "headingHinglish": "Part D: Safety aur myths: mobile aur Wi-Fi ki sachchai",
            "body": "Mobile, Wi-Fi aur tower ki radiation ke baare mein bahut daraane wali baatein ghoomti rehti hain. Ek **sachchi aur seedhi** tasveer:\n\n1. Ye waves EM parivaar ke **lambi wavelength** wale hisse (radio aur microwave) mein hain. Inme X-ray jaisi taaqat nahi hoti ki wo atoms se electrons ko nikaal kar cells ko tod saken. Is baat ko \"ionising aur non-ionising\" naam se Topic 5 mein theek se dekhenge.\n2. Inka **power bahut kam** hota hai: ek phone ya router ki power aam taur par ek watt ke aas-paas ya usse kam (lagbhag), jo oven jaise band dabbe ke saikdon guna kam hai.\n3. Duniya bhar ki vaigyanik sansthayein **safe limit ke guidelines** banati hain, aur phone aur tower unke andar rehne chahiye. Zyadatar adhyayan mein guidelines ke andar koi pakka nuksaan nahi mila, par lambi avadhi par research chalta rehta hai.\n4. Phir bhi **samajhdaari wali savdhaani** theek hai: kisi call ko chhota rakho, lambi baat mein speaker ya earphone use karo, aur signal kamzor ho to phone zyada power lagata hai, to wahan lambi call se bachho. Sote waqt phone **takiye ke neeche** nahi: wahan garam ho sakta hai aur neend bhi kharab hoti hai. Ye sab **ghar par adult se baat** karke ghar ka niyam banao.\n\nIs paragraph ka matlab ye nahi ki \"kuch fark nahi padta,\" ye hai ki **darne ki jagah samajh se kaam lo.**",
            "bodyHinglish": "Mobile, Wi-Fi aur tower ki radiation ke baare mein bahut daraane wali baatein ghoomti rehti hain. Ek **sachchi aur seedhi** tasveer:\n\n1. Ye waves EM parivaar ke **lambi wavelength** wale hisse (radio aur microwave) mein hain. Inme X-ray jaisi taaqat nahi hoti ki wo atoms se electrons ko nikaal kar cells ko tod saken. Is baat ko \"ionising aur non-ionising\" naam se Topic 5 mein theek se dekhenge.\n2. Inka **power bahut kam** hota hai: ek phone ya router ki power aam taur par ek watt ke aas-paas ya usse kam (lagbhag), jo oven jaise band dabbe ke saikdon guna kam hai.\n3. Duniya bhar ki vaigyanik sansthayein **safe limit ke guidelines** banati hain, aur phone aur tower unke andar rehne chahiye. Zyadatar adhyayan mein guidelines ke andar koi pakka nuksaan nahi mila, par lambi avadhi par research chalta rehta hai.\n4. Phir bhi **samajhdaari wali savdhaani** theek hai: kisi call ko chhota rakho, lambi baat mein speaker ya earphone use karo, aur signal kamzor ho to phone zyada power lagata hai, to wahan lambi call se bachho. Sote waqt phone **takiye ke neeche** nahi: wahan garam ho sakta hai aur neend bhi kharab hoti hai. Ye sab **ghar par adult se baat** karke ghar ka niyam banao.\n\nIs paragraph ka matlab ye nahi ki \"kuch fark nahi padta,\" ye hai ki **darne ki jagah samajh se kaam lo.**"
