            "bodyHinglish": "Mr. Ogale ke bhanje **Mayur** ke school mein \"Spectrum Mela\" laga tha. Hall mein saat stall the, har stall par ek wave ka naam: Radio, Microwave, Infrared, Visible, Ultraviolet, X-ray, Gamma. Mayur ko aakhri ghante mein teacher ne ek kaam diya: \"Saaton stall ghoomo aur ek hi chart mein likho ki kaun si wave kitni lambi hai, kitni tez dolti hai, kahan se aati hai aur kis kaam aati hai.\"\n\nMayur ne teen stall ghoom kar hi haath khada kar diya. \"Mama,\" usne Mr. Ogale se kaha, jo use lene aaye the, \"mere paas itne numbers hain, 1 mm, 400 nm, 2.45 GHz, 0.01 nm. Kaun sa formula kab lagaun, ye hi samajh nahi aa raha. Ek stall par bola gaya ki frequency badhne se wavelength ghatti hai, doosre par kisi ne kaha ki laal rang ki frequency sabse zyada hai. Kaun sahi hai?\" Mr. Ogale hanse, \"Chal, ek-ek karke: pehle ek chhota sa 'kab kya' chart, phir kuch sawal, phir tera master table. Aakhir mein tu khud bata dega ki kaun sahi tha.\" Is kahani ka jawab hum \"Wapas Spectrum Mela mein\" section mein denge."
