            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Order of magnitude (kitne guna ka andaaza)** | Kisi number ko 10 ki power se tolna, taki pata chale ki wo 10, 1000 ya 10 lakh guna bada hai | 3 × 10⁸ aur 340 mein lagbhag 10⁶ guna ka fark |\n| **Band edge (kinara)** | Do regions ke beech ki dhundhli seema jahan wave dono mein gini ja sakti hai | 1 GHz ya 30 cm ke aas-paas ki wave |\n| **Master table** | Saare regions ko ek hi jagah wavelength, frequency, source, use aur hazard ke saath rakhna | Is topic ki Table, Part B |\n| **Andaaza jaanch (sanity check)** | Jawab nikalne ke baad dekhna ki wo region ki seema ke andar aata hai ya nahi | 450 nm ki frequency radio ki nikle to kuch galat hai |",
