            "bodyHinglish": "Itwaar ki subah Mr. Gurjar apni bhanji Bhagyashree ko mohalle ke park mein le gaye. Park mein teen jhoole the. Chhote bachhon ka jhoola chhoti chain ka tha, beech wala jhoola thoda lamba tha, aur sabse kone wala bada jhoola bahut lambi chains par latka tha. Har jhoole par ek bachha baitha tha aur ek bada uske peechhe khada dhakka de raha tha.\n\nBhagyashree bench par baithi dekh rahi thi. Achanak wo boli, \"Mama, ek ajeeb baat hai. Chhote jhoole ka bachha jaldi-jaldi aage-peechhe ho raha hai. Bade jhoole wala to ek chakkar poora karne mein jaise **ages** laga raha hai. Dono ko ek jaisa dhakka mila hai, phir bhi!\"\n\nMr. Gurjar muskuraye. \"Aur ek baat dekho. Abhi jo bachha bada jhoola jhool raha hai, uski jagah uska bada bhai baith jaaye to?\" Bhagyashree soch mein padh gayi. \"Shayad jhoola dheema ho jaayega, kyunki wo bhaari hai?\" \"Ye tumhara guess hai,\" Mr. Gurjar bole. \"Aaj hum ise guess nahi, **pakki baat** bana kar chhodenge. Aur hum ye bhi dekhenge ki har cheez ki apni ek 'dhun' hoti hai.\""
