            "body": "School ke music room mein Mr. Rahalkar ne apni bhatiji Radhika ko ek tuning fork diya. Fork par 320 Hz likha tha. Radhika ne fork ko rubber pad par halke se maara aur hawa mein pakad kar kaan ke paas laayi. Awaaz aayi, par bahut **dheemi**, bas kaan ke paas sunai deti thi.\n\nChacha ne kaha, \"Ab fork ke neeche ka dandi wala hissa (stem) is lakdi ki desk par halke se tika do.\" Radhika ne tikaya, aur poora kamra \"tiiiin\" ki awaaz se bhar gaya. Awaaz **bahut loud** thi!\n\nRadhika boli, \"Chacha, fork to wahi hai, usne zyada zor se to hila nahi. Phir desk par rakhte hi awaaz loud kaise ho gayi? Kya desk ne apni koi tune gaa di? Aur fork ki awaaz jaldi band kyun ho gayi?\" Chacha muskuraye, \"Teeno sawaal ek hi baat se jude hain: **desk ko fork ne hilaya hai.** Ye idea samajh lo, phir 'Wapas music room mein' ke hissa mein teeno jawab milenge.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School ke music room mein Mr. Rahalkar ne apni bhatiji Radhika ko ek tuning fork diya. Fork par 320 Hz likha tha. Radhika ne fork ko rubber pad par halke se maara aur hawa mein pakad kar kaan ke paas laayi. Awaaz aayi, par bahut **dheemi**, bas kaan ke paas sunai deti thi.\n\nChacha ne kaha, \"Ab fork ke neeche ka dandi wala hissa (stem) is lakdi ki desk par halke se tika do.\" Radhika ne tikaya, aur poora kamra \"tiiiin\" ki awaaz se bhar gaya. Awaaz **bahut loud** thi!\n\nRadhika boli, \"Chacha, fork to wahi hai, usne zyada zor se to hila nahi. Phir desk par rakhte hi awaaz loud kaise ho gayi? Kya desk ne apni koi tune gaa di? Aur fork ki awaaz jaldi band kyun ho gayi?\" Chacha muskuraye, \"Teeno sawaal ek hi baat se jude hain: **desk ko fork ne hilaya hai.** Ye idea samajh lo, phir 'Wapas music room mein' ke hissa mein teeno jawab milenge.\""
