            "headingHinglish": "Society garden ka jhoola",
            "body": "Shaam ko society garden mein Mr. Sahasrabudhe apni bhanji Sanjana ke saath aaye. Garden ke kone mein ek jhoola tha, jiski chain lagbhag 3 m lambi thi. Sanjana jhoole par baith gayi, dono chains pakad li, aur Mama peeche khade ho gaye. (Jhoole par sirf baithte hain, khade nahi hote, aur peeche koi bada saath hona chahiye.)\n\nPehle Mama ne ek-do baar jhoole ko zor se dhakka diya, kabhi jab Sanjana aage aa rahi thi, kabhi jab peeche ja rahi thi. Jhoola halka sa hila, aur thodi der mein phir lagbhag ruk gaya. Phir Mama ne apni ghadi dekhi: \"Ab 10 jhoole ginte hain.\" 10 jhoolon mein 35 s lage. Phir unhone bahut halke taps dene shuru kiye: ek tap **har jhoole mein ek baar**, theek us pal jab Sanjana peeche ke sabse door point se aage ki taraf jaana shuru karti thi. Dheere-dheere jhoola oopar-oopar uthne laga!\n\nSanjana hairaan thi. \"Mama, pehle aap zor se dhakka dete the aur kuch nahi hua. Ab bas halka tap de rahe ho aur main itni oopar ja rahi hoon! Ye jaadu hai kya?\" Mama muskuraye, \"Jaadu nahi, ye **resonance** hai. Thodi der mein samjhaate hain. Pehle wapas chalo us 35 s wali ghadi par, usmein poora raaz chhupa hai.\"",
