            "heading": "Vibration Mela ka buzzer round",
            "headingHinglish": "Vibration Mela ka buzzer round",
            "body": "School mein \"Vibration Mela\" laga tha. Mr. Yardi apni bhatiji Mukta ko mela dikhane laye. Pehle stall par Barton's pendulums the, jahan ek bhaari driver ke saath paanch halke pendulums latke the (Topic 4 jaisa), dusre stall par ek patli ruler ka \"diving board\" tha jisse overhang badal kar uski dhun badalti thi, aur teesre stall par tuning fork ek desk par rakha tha. Sabse bheed **buzzer round** par thi.\n\nQuizmaster ne poochha, \"Ek jhoole ko ek baar dhakka diya aur chhod diya. Ye kaun sa vibration hai?\" Mukta ne bina soche buzzer daba diya, \"Forced vibration!\" Buzzer ne ghanti bajayi, par jawab galat nikla. Agle sawaal par wo \"damped\" bol gayi, jabki sahi jawab kuch aur tha. Teen sawaal ke baad uska score zero tha.\n\nBahar aakar wo udaas thi. \"Chacha, naam sab yaad hain, par buzzer ke waqt sab ghul-mil jaate hain.\" Chacha hanse, \"Naam yaad karne se nahi, **teen sawaal** poochne se jawab milta hai. Chalo, ek table aur ek chart banate hain. Agle round tak tum buzzer ki raja ho jaogi.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School mein \"Vibration Mela\" laga tha. Mr. Yardi apni bhatiji Mukta ko mela dikhane laye. Pehle stall par Barton's pendulums the, jahan ek bhaari driver ke saath paanch halke pendulums latke the (Topic 4 jaisa), dusre stall par ek patli ruler ka \"diving board\" tha jisse overhang badal kar uski dhun badalti thi, aur teesre stall par tuning fork ek desk par rakha tha. Sabse bheed **buzzer round** par thi.\n\nQuizmaster ne poochha, \"Ek jhoole ko ek baar dhakka diya aur chhod diya. Ye kaun sa vibration hai?\" Mukta ne bina soche buzzer daba diya, \"Forced vibration!\" Buzzer ne ghanti bajayi, par jawab galat nikla. Agle sawaal par wo \"damped\" bol gayi, jabki sahi jawab kuch aur tha. Teen sawaal ke baad uska score zero tha.\n\nBahar aakar wo udaas thi. \"Chacha, naam sab yaad hain, par buzzer ke waqt sab ghul-mil jaate hain.\" Chacha hanse, \"Naam yaad karne se nahi, **teen sawaal** poochne se jawab milta hai. Chalo, ek table aur ek chart banate hain. Agle round tak tum buzzer ki raja ho jaogi.\""
