            "body": "Topic 1 aur Topic 2 mein humne cell ke andar jhaanka (E aur r) aur cells ko jodna seekha. Ab hum cell ko ek bharosemand source maan kar **baahar ke network** ko dekhte hain. Class 9 mein series aur parallel ko ek-ek karke \"reduce\" karna aa gaya, par kuch circuits aise hote hain jinmein na koi resistor saaf series mein dikhta hai, na parallel mein. Aaj teen nayi aankhein milengi: **symmetry** (circuit ka mirror), **equal potential points** (jahan current ka kaam hi nahi) aur **divider** (voltage ka hissa nikaalna), saath mein ye bhi ki asli meters circuit ko kitna hilati hain.",
