            "headingHinglish": "Part B: Rating ka matlab, aur samay ka rishta",
            "body": "**Fuse rating** wo current hai jo fuse bina pighle **lagataar** jhel leta hai. Rating se thoda upar current par wo turant nahi udta: pehle garm hota hai, aur jitna zyada current, utna kam samay. Neeche ek **illustration table** hai (lagbhag aur hedged: asli fuse ka naksha uske maker ke datasheet mein aata hai):\n\n| Current (rating ka kitna guna) | Fuse kitni der mein udta hai (lagbhag) |\n|---|---|\n| 1.0 guna | Nahi udta (lagataar chalta hai) |\n| 1.5 guna | Kai minute se lekar ghanta |\n| 2 guna | Kuch second se ek-do minute |\n| 4 guna | Lagbhag ek second ya usse kam |\n| 10 guna | Second ke kuch sau-wen hisse |\n\nIsi se do taraf ki sahi rating samajh aati hai: rating **normal current se upar** ho (warna normal kaam mein hi udega), par **bahut upar nahi** (warna asli fault par bhi nahi udega).\n\n### Example 3: Plug ka cartridge fuse chunna\n\n**Given:** Plug mein 5 A ya 13 A ka cartridge fuse lag sakta hai. Do appliances: toaster 805 W aur room heater 2.185 kW, supply 230 V.\n**Find:** Har ka normal current aur kaun sa fuse.\n**Formula:** I = P ÷ V; fuse rating ≥ I, aur thodi margin.\n**Substitution:** Toaster: I = 805 W ÷ 230 V = 3.5 A. Heater: I = 2185 W ÷ 230 V = 9.5 A.\n**Answer:** Toaster ke liye **5 A** (3.5 A < 5 A, 1.5 A margin). Heater ke liye **13 A** (9.5 A < 13 A, 3.5 A margin; 5 A to heater ke chalte hi udta).\n**Jaanch:** 3.5 A × 230 V = 805 W ✅. 9.5 A × 230 V = 2185 W ✅. Toaster par 13 A kyun nahi? Agar toaster mein fault se current 8 A ho jaaye, 13 A ka fuse use \"normal\" maanega, aur toaster ki patli lead garm hogi: chhote appliance ko chhoti rating ka fuse hi bachata hai ✅\n\n### Example 4: Galat fuse ho to kya hoga?\n\n**Given:** Wahi 2.185 kW heater ko galti se 5 A ke fuse wale plug mein lagaya, 230 V.\n**Find:** Fuse kya karega?\n**Formula:** I = P ÷ V; multiple = I ÷ rating; upar ki table padho.\n**Substitution:** I = 2185 W ÷ 230 V = 9.5 A. Multiple = 9.5 A ÷ 5 A = 1.9.\n**Answer:** Current rating ka lagbhag 2 guna (1.9) hai, table ke hisaab se fuse **kuch second se ek-do minute** mein udega: ghar ka wiring bach gaya, par heater chalega hi nahi.\n**Jaanch:** 1.9 × 5 A = 9.5 A ✅. Heat ki dar ka bhi sach: rating par I² R ka 25 A² hai, aur 9.5 A par 90.25 A²: lagbhag 3.6 guna ✅ (isliye samay itna kam).",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Fuse rating** wo current hai jo fuse bina pighle **lagataar** jhel leta hai. Rating se thoda upar current par wo turant nahi udta: pehle garm hota hai, aur jitna zyada current, utna kam samay. Neeche ek **illustration table** hai (lagbhag aur hedged: asli fuse ka naksha uske maker ke datasheet mein aata hai):\n\n| Current (rating ka kitna guna) | Fuse kitni der mein udta hai (lagbhag) |\n|---|---|\n| 1.0 guna | Nahi udta (lagataar chalta hai) |\n| 1.5 guna | Kai minute se lekar ghanta |\n| 2 guna | Kuch second se ek-do minute |\n| 4 guna | Lagbhag ek second ya usse kam |\n| 10 guna | Second ke kuch sau-wen hisse |\n\nIsi se do taraf ki sahi rating samajh aati hai: rating **normal current se upar** ho (warna normal kaam mein hi udega), par **bahut upar nahi** (warna asli fault par bhi nahi udega).\n\n### Example 3: Plug ka cartridge fuse chunna\n\n**Given:** Plug mein 5 A ya 13 A ka cartridge fuse lag sakta hai. Do appliances: toaster 805 W aur room heater 2.185 kW, supply 230 V.\n**Find:** Har ka normal current aur kaun sa fuse.\n**Formula:** I = P ÷ V; fuse rating ≥ I, aur thodi margin.\n**Substitution:** Toaster: I = 805 W ÷ 230 V = 3.5 A. Heater: I = 2185 W ÷ 230 V = 9.5 A.\n**Answer:** Toaster ke liye **5 A** (3.5 A < 5 A, 1.5 A margin). Heater ke liye **13 A** (9.5 A < 13 A, 3.5 A margin; 5 A to heater ke chalte hi udta).\n**Jaanch:** 3.5 A × 230 V = 805 W ✅. 9.5 A × 230 V = 2185 W ✅. Toaster par 13 A kyun nahi? Agar toaster mein fault se current 8 A ho jaaye, 13 A ka fuse use \"normal\" maanega, aur toaster ki patli lead garm hogi: chhote appliance ko chhoti rating ka fuse hi bachata hai ✅\n\n### Example 4: Galat fuse ho to kya hoga?\n\n**Given:** Wahi 2.185 kW heater ko galti se 5 A ke fuse wale plug mein lagaya, 230 V.\n**Find:** Fuse kya karega?\n**Formula:** I = P ÷ V; multiple = I ÷ rating; upar ki table padho.\n**Substitution:** I = 2185 W ÷ 230 V = 9.5 A. Multiple = 9.5 A ÷ 5 A = 1.9.\n**Answer:** Current rating ka lagbhag 2 guna (1.9) hai, table ke hisaab se fuse **kuch second se ek-do minute** mein udega: ghar ka wiring bach gaya, par heater chalega hi nahi.\n**Jaanch:** 1.9 × 5 A = 9.5 A ✅. Heat ki dar ka bhi sach: rating par I² R ka 25 A² hai, aur 9.5 A par 90.25 A²: lagbhag 3.6 guna ✅ (isliye samay itna kam)."
