            "heading": "Part C: Fuse ke prakaar",
            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Fuse ke prakaar",
            "body": "| Prakaar | Kaisa dikhta hai | Kahan | Khaas baat |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Rewirable** | Porcelain carrier mein do screw aur beech mein fuse wire (Figure 1.2) | Purane ghar ke box | Udne par sirf wire badalna padta hai, par galat taar daalne ka khatra rehta hai: **sirf electrician** |\n| **Cartridge** | Chhoti band glass ya ceramic ki nali, dono sire par dhaatu ki cap | Plug aur appliance ke andar | Element andar band: dikhta nahi, udne par poori nali badlo |\n| **HRC** | Majboot ceramic nali, aksar andar bareek, sand jaisa bharav (lagbhag) jo spark bujhata hai | Bade panel aur factory | Bahut bade fault current ko bhi surakshit rokta hai |\n| **Blade** | Plastic ka chhota khaana, do dhaatu ki pattiyan | Car ka fuse box | Rang se rating pehchaanti hai |\n\nCar ke blade fuse mein **rang rating batata hai** (aam taur par): 5 A tan (halka bhura), 10 A laal, 15 A neela, 20 A peela. (Rang gaadi ke manual se milao: sirf dekh kar, aur sahi blade hi lagao.)",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Prakaar | Kaisa dikhta hai | Kahan | Khaas baat |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Rewirable** | Porcelain carrier mein do screw aur beech mein fuse wire (Figure 1.2) | Purane ghar ke box | Udne par sirf wire badalna padta hai, par galat taar daalne ka khatra rehta hai: **sirf electrician** |\n| **Cartridge** | Chhoti band glass ya ceramic ki nali, dono sire par dhaatu ki cap | Plug aur appliance ke andar | Element andar band: dikhta nahi, udne par poori nali badlo |\n| **HRC** | Majboot ceramic nali, aksar andar bareek, sand jaisa bharav (lagbhag) jo spark bujhata hai | Bade panel aur factory | Bahut bade fault current ko bhi surakshit rokta hai |\n| **Blade** | Plastic ka chhota khaana, do dhaatu ki pattiyan | Car ka fuse box | Rang se rating pehchaanti hai |\n\nCar ke blade fuse mein **rang rating batata hai** (aam taur par): 5 A tan (halka bhura), 10 A laal, 15 A neela, 20 A peela. (Rang gaadi ke manual se milao: sirf dekh kar, aur sahi blade hi lagao.)"
