            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 1 mein humne fuse aur MCB ko dekha: ye wiring ko garam hokar jalne se bachate hain. Par ek sawaal bacha tha: **insaan ko kaun bachata hai?** Ek aadmi ko khatarnaak jhatka lagne ke liye amperes ka current nahi chahiye, kuch milli-amperes (mA) hi kaafi hain, jabki fuse ya MCB tab hi chalte hain jab current amperes mein chadh jaaye. Class 9 mein humne dekha tha ki earth wire fault ke waqt body ko zameen se jodkar bachati hai. Aaj hum is kahani mein **numbers** bharenge: kitna current, kitna voltage, kitni der, aur kaun sa device kis kaam ka.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Topic 1 mein humne fuse aur MCB ko dekha: ye wiring ko garam hokar jalne se bachate hain. Par ek sawaal bacha tha: **insaan ko kaun bachata hai?** Ek aadmi ko khatarnaak jhatka lagne ke liye amperes ka current nahi chahiye, kuch milli-amperes (mA) hi kaafi hain, jabki fuse ya MCB tab hi chalte hain jab current amperes mein chadh jaaye. Class 9 mein humne dekha tha ki earth wire fault ke waqt body ko zameen se jodkar bachati hai. Aaj hum is kahani mein **numbers** bharenge: kitna current, kitna voltage, kitni der, aur kaun sa device kis kaam ka."
