            "heading": "Part C: Double insulation: jab earth pin ki zaroorat nahi",
            "headingHinglish": "Part C: Double insulation: jab earth pin ki zaroorat nahi",
            "body": "Hair dryer, mixer aur chhote charger par aksar **square ke andar square** ka nishaan hota hai aur plug do-pin ka hota hai. Isme bijli ke live hisse ke upar **pehli insulation** hoti hai, aur andar ke dhaatu ke hisson ke upar **doosri insulation** (plastic ka bahari khol). Haath sirf is bahari khol ko chhoota hai. Ek insulation ghis bhi jaaye to doosri parat haath aur live taar ke beech bani rehti hai. Isliye body ko earth karne ki zaroorat nahi, aur earth pin nahi hoti.\n\n```\n(a) Nishaan               (b) Parte, andar se bahar\n\n  +---------------+       [     live parts: taar aur motor     ]\n  :               :                          :\n  :   +-------+   :       [          pehli insulation          ]\n  :   :       :   :                          :\n  :   +-------+   :       [      andar ke dhaatu ke hisse      ]\n  :               :                          :\n  +---------------+       [ doosri insulation: plastic ka khol ]\n                                             :\nsquare ke andar square    [      haath yahin chhoota hai       ]\n```\n\n> **Figure 2.4** – Double insulation: (a) square ke andar square ka nishaan, (b) live hisse se haath tak do alag insulation ki parte.\n\nDhyan do: double insulation tabhi tak surakshit hai jab khol tootta ya geela na ho. Tooti hui body wala double-insulated appliance bhi khatarnaak ho sakta hai. **Rating plate par nishaan padhna** theek hai; appliance kholkar dekhna kabhi nahi.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Hair dryer, mixer aur chhote charger par aksar **square ke andar square** ka nishaan hota hai aur plug do-pin ka hota hai. Isme bijli ke live hisse ke upar **pehli insulation** hoti hai, aur andar ke dhaatu ke hisson ke upar **doosri insulation** (plastic ka bahari khol). Haath sirf is bahari khol ko chhoota hai. Ek insulation ghis bhi jaaye to doosri parat haath aur live taar ke beech bani rehti hai. Isliye body ko earth karne ki zaroorat nahi, aur earth pin nahi hoti.\n\n```\n(a) Nishaan               (b) Parte, andar se bahar\n\n  +---------------+       [     live parts: taar aur motor     ]\n  :               :                          :\n  :   +-------+   :       [          pehli insulation          ]\n  :   :       :   :                          :\n  :   +-------+   :       [      andar ke dhaatu ke hisse      ]\n  :               :                          :\n  +---------------+       [ doosri insulation: plastic ka khol ]\n                                             :\nsquare ke andar square    [      haath yahin chhoota hai       ]\n```\n\n> **Figure 2.4** – Double insulation: (a) square ke andar square ka nishaan, (b) live hisse se haath tak do alag insulation ki parte.\n\nDhyan do: double insulation tabhi tak surakshit hai jab khol tootta ya geela na ho. Tooti hui body wala double-insulated appliance bhi khatarnaak ho sakta hai. **Rating plate par nishaan padhna** theek hai; appliance kholkar dekhna kabhi nahi."
