            "heading": "Shaadi hall ka garm multi-plug",
            "headingHinglish": "Shaadi hall ka garm multi-plug",
            "body": "Tulpule Mama ke ghar mein shaadi thi, aur shaam ko wo apne bhanje Vinit ko lekar shaadi hall dekhne gaye, jahan sajawat chal rahi thi. Stage ke peeche decorator ke ladke ne purani peeli bulb wali jhaalar ki bahut saari ladiyan, ek speaker aur chai ka bada garm-paani wala dibba, sab ek hi multi-plug mein ghused diye the. Multi-plug ek lambi taar se deewar ke socket tak ja raha tha.\n\nVinit ne dekha ki multi-plug ka plastic halka chamak raha hai. \"Mama, ye garm kyun lag raha hai?\" Usne haath badhaya hi tha ki Mama ne uska kandha pakad kar peeche kheencha. Tab tak ek tez smell aa chuki thi: **jalte hue plastic ki**. Hall ke electrician ne bhaagkar **main switch band kiya**, aur phir tab jaakar multi-plug ko torch se dekha. Socket ke aas-paas ka plastic kaala aur thoda pighla hua tha.\n\nVinit ne dheere se poocha, \"Mama, ghar mein to MCB hota hai na? Wo kyun nahi gira? Aur ye multi-plug jal kyun raha tha jabki koi taar nahi tooti?\" Mama ne kaha, \"Bahut achhe sawaal hain. Aaj inhi ka jawab milega: ghar mein bijli kab-kab aur kitni tarah se galat ho sakti hai, aur MCB kis galti ko pakadta hai aur kisko chhod deta hai.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Tulpule Mama ke ghar mein shaadi thi, aur shaam ko wo apne bhanje Vinit ko lekar shaadi hall dekhne gaye, jahan sajawat chal rahi thi. Stage ke peeche decorator ke ladke ne purani peeli bulb wali jhaalar ki bahut saari ladiyan, ek speaker aur chai ka bada garm-paani wala dibba, sab ek hi multi-plug mein ghused diye the. Multi-plug ek lambi taar se deewar ke socket tak ja raha tha.\n\nVinit ne dekha ki multi-plug ka plastic halka chamak raha hai. \"Mama, ye garm kyun lag raha hai?\" Usne haath badhaya hi tha ki Mama ne uska kandha pakad kar peeche kheencha. Tab tak ek tez smell aa chuki thi: **jalte hue plastic ki**. Hall ke electrician ne bhaagkar **main switch band kiya**, aur phir tab jaakar multi-plug ko torch se dekha. Socket ke aas-paas ka plastic kaala aur thoda pighla hua tha.\n\nVinit ne dheere se poocha, \"Mama, ghar mein to MCB hota hai na? Wo kyun nahi gira? Aur ye multi-plug jal kyun raha tha jabki koi taar nahi tooti?\" Mama ne kaha, \"Bahut achhe sawaal hain. Aaj inhi ka jawab milega: ghar mein bijli kab-kab aur kitni tarah se galat ho sakti hai, aur MCB kis galti ko pakadta hai aur kisko chhod deta hai.\""
