            "heading": "Naye shabd",
            "headingHinglish": "Naye shabd",
            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Loop resistance** | Live taar jaane aur neutral taar wapas aane ka milakar kul resistance, supply se galti ki jagah tak (Topic 2 mein fault ke loop mein earth wire ke saath dekha tha) | Board se door ke socket tak ka lagbhag 0.46 Ω |\n| **Contact resistance** | Do jode hue hisson (plug ki pin aur socket, taar aur screw) ke chhoone ki jagah ka resistance. Dheela ya zang laga ho to ye bahut badh jaata hai | Dheeli pin ka socket |\n| **Hot spot** | Bahut chhoti jagah jahan I² R ki garmi ikatthi ho jaati hai, jabki baaki taar thandi rehti hai | Plug ki pin ke paas ka plastic jo kaala pad gaya |\n| **Arcing** | Do sirey ke beech hawa mein se current ka chingari banke kood jaana | Dheele plug se nikalti chingari |\n| **Surge** | Supply ke voltage ka bahut thodi der ke liye achanak bahut badh jaana | Paas mein bijli girne ke baad ka jhatka |\n| **Surge protector** | Wo device jo achanak badhe voltage ko appliance tak poora nahi pahunchne deta | Computer ke multi-plug mein laga surge protector |\n| **Voltage stabiliser** | Wo device jo supply ka voltage ghatne-badhne par bhi appliance ko lagbhag tay voltage deta hai | Refrigerator ke saath laga stabiliser |\n| **Standard mark** | Product par ka wo nishaan jo batata hai ki use jaanch-parakh ke standard par parkha gaya hai | Plug aur taar par ISI ya BIS ka nishaan |\n| **Electrical fire** | Aisi aag jo bijli ke upkaran ya taar mein lage jab supply abhi chalu ho | Jalta hua multi-plug |\n| **Dry powder extinguisher** | Aag bujhane wala cylinder jisme sookha powder hota hai, jo aag ko dhak deta hai | Dukaan aur office mein laga lal cylinder |\n\n---\n\n> **Suraksha:** Ye topic **sirf padhne aur samajhne ke liye** hai. Mains ki wiring, plug, socket, switch ya kisi bhi appliance ko **kabhi mat chhuo, mat kholo, mat test karo**. Garm plug, kaali pad chuki socket ya jalne ki smell ho to **door hato aur turant kisi bade ya electrician ko batao**. Label aur rating plate padhna theek hai (bade ke saath, kuch kholna nahi). Cell ya battery ko kabhi seedha taar se mat jodo.",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Loop resistance** | Live taar jaane aur neutral taar wapas aane ka milakar kul resistance, supply se galti ki jagah tak (Topic 2 mein fault ke loop mein earth wire ke saath dekha tha) | Board se door ke socket tak ka lagbhag 0.46 Ω |\n| **Contact resistance** | Do jode hue hisson (plug ki pin aur socket, taar aur screw) ke chhoone ki jagah ka resistance. Dheela ya zang laga ho to ye bahut badh jaata hai | Dheeli pin ka socket |\n| **Hot spot** | Bahut chhoti jagah jahan I² R ki garmi ikatthi ho jaati hai, jabki baaki taar thandi rehti hai | Plug ki pin ke paas ka plastic jo kaala pad gaya |\n| **Arcing** | Do sirey ke beech hawa mein se current ka chingari banke kood jaana | Dheele plug se nikalti chingari |\n| **Surge** | Supply ke voltage ka bahut thodi der ke liye achanak bahut badh jaana | Paas mein bijli girne ke baad ka jhatka |\n| **Surge protector** | Wo device jo achanak badhe voltage ko appliance tak poora nahi pahunchne deta | Computer ke multi-plug mein laga surge protector |\n| **Voltage stabiliser** | Wo device jo supply ka voltage ghatne-badhne par bhi appliance ko lagbhag tay voltage deta hai | Refrigerator ke saath laga stabiliser |\n| **Standard mark** | Product par ka wo nishaan jo batata hai ki use jaanch-parakh ke standard par parkha gaya hai | Plug aur taar par ISI ya BIS ka nishaan |\n| **Electrical fire** | Aisi aag jo bijli ke upkaran ya taar mein lage jab supply abhi chalu ho | Jalta hua multi-plug |\n| **Dry powder extinguisher** | Aag bujhane wala cylinder jisme sookha powder hota hai, jo aag ko dhak deta hai | Dukaan aur office mein laga lal cylinder |\n\n---\n\n> **Suraksha:** Ye topic **sirf padhne aur samajhne ke liye** hai. Mains ki wiring, plug, socket, switch ya kisi bhi appliance ko **kabhi mat chhuo, mat kholo, mat test karo**. Garm plug, kaali pad chuki socket ya jalne ki smell ho to **door hato aur turant kisi bade ya electrician ko batao**. Label aur rating plate padhna theek hai (bade ke saath, kuch kholna nahi). Cell ya battery ko kabhi seedha taar se mat jodo."
