            "heading": "Part D: Emf kitna bada banega?",
            "headingHinglish": "Part D: Emf kitna bada banega?",
            "body": "Faraday ke teen factor ab ek chhote sutra mein: **induced emf e ∝ N × (field badalne ki rate)**. N = coil ke pher. Rate zyada hogi jab magnet tez chale ya zyada tagda ho.\n\n- Pher double to emf **double** (rate wahi).\n- Magnet ko aadhe time mein andar dhakela to rate **double**, to emf **double**.\n- Dono saath mein badlen to **guna** karte jaao.\n\n### Example 4: Ratio se emf\n\nEk coil (200 pher) mein magnet 30 cm/s se dhakelne par meter 2.5 mV dikhata hai. Ab 280 pher ki coil aur magnet 45 cm/s se. Naya emf?\n\n- **Given:** e₁ = 2.5 mV; N: 200 → 280; chaal: 30 cm/s → 45 cm/s\n- **Find:** e₂\n- **Formula:** e ∝ N × rate; rate chaal ke barabar badhti hai\n- **Substitution:** pher ka ratio = 280 ÷ 200 = 1.4; chaal ka ratio = 45 ÷ 30 = 1.5. e₂ = 2.5 mV × 1.4 × 1.5 = **5.25 mV**.\n\n**Jaanch:** 5.25 ÷ 2.5 = 2.1 aur 1.4 × 1.5 = 2.1 ✅. Units mV: dono taraf mV ✅.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Faraday ke teen factor ab ek chhote sutra mein: **induced emf e ∝ N × (field badalne ki rate)**. N = coil ke pher. Rate zyada hogi jab magnet tez chale ya zyada tagda ho.\n\n- Pher double to emf **double** (rate wahi).\n- Magnet ko aadhe time mein andar dhakela to rate **double**, to emf **double**.\n- Dono saath mein badlen to **guna** karte jaao.\n\n### Example 4: Ratio se emf\n\nEk coil (200 pher) mein magnet 30 cm/s se dhakelne par meter 2.5 mV dikhata hai. Ab 280 pher ki coil aur magnet 45 cm/s se. Naya emf?\n\n- **Given:** e₁ = 2.5 mV; N: 200 → 280; chaal: 30 cm/s → 45 cm/s\n- **Find:** e₂\n- **Formula:** e ∝ N × rate; rate chaal ke barabar badhti hai\n- **Substitution:** pher ka ratio = 280 ÷ 200 = 1.4; chaal ka ratio = 45 ÷ 30 = 1.5. e₂ = 2.5 mV × 1.4 × 1.5 = **5.25 mV**.\n\n**Jaanch:** 5.25 ÷ 2.5 = 2.1 aur 1.4 × 1.5 = 2.1 ✅. Units mV: dono taraf mV ✅."
