            "heading": "Introduction",
            "headingHinglish": "Introduction",
            "body": "Topic 4 ke ant mein ek sawaal chhoda tha: AC ka voltage aasaani se badla ja sakta hai, par kaise? Topic 3 mein dekha tha ki **badalta hua** field coil mein voltage banata hai, aur Topic 4 mein dekha ki AC ka current har pal badalta rehta hai. In dono ko jodo to transformer ka raaz khul jaata hai: ek coil mein **badalta current** badalta field banata hai, aur wo field paas ki doosri coil mein voltage **induce** kar deta hai. Aaj hum is machine ko andar se kholkar samjhenge (sirf kaagaz par!), uski ginti seekhenge, aur Chapter 8 ka ek vaada bhi poora karenge: RCCB ko current ka farak \"mehsoos\" kaise hota hai.",
