            "heading": "Class 9 ka recall",
            "headingHinglish": "Class 9 ka recall",
            "body": "Class 9 mein teen alag baatein dekhi thi. Pehli: current ke aas-paas field banta hai (Oersted, 1820), right-hand thumb rule se uski disha, aur solenoid aur electromagnet ([magnetism-part4.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part4.md), [magnetism-part5.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part5.md)). Doosri: field mein current wale taar par force lagta hai, left-hand rule se, aur isi se motor ghoomti hai. Teesri: badalte field se current banta hai (Faraday, 1831), aur isi se generator aur dynamo chalte hain ([magnetism-part6.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part6.md)). Class 9 ne ye teeno alag-alag sikhaye the; is chapter ne unmein rules, numbers aur Lenz ka niyam joda. Ab hum teeno ko ek naksha mein rakhte hain.",
            "bodyHinglish": "Class 9 mein teen alag baatein dekhi thi. Pehli: current ke aas-paas field banta hai (Oersted, 1820), right-hand thumb rule se uski disha, aur solenoid aur electromagnet ([magnetism-part4.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part4.md), [magnetism-part5.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part5.md)). Doosri: field mein current wale taar par force lagta hai, left-hand rule se, aur isi se motor ghoomti hai. Teesri: badalte field se current banta hai (Faraday, 1831), aur isi se generator aur dynamo chalte hain ([magnetism-part6.md](../../../class9/physics/magnetism/magnetism-part6.md)). Class 9 ne ye teeno alag-alag sikhaye the; is chapter ne unmein rules, numbers aur Lenz ka niyam joda. Ab hum teeno ko ek naksha mein rakhte hain."
