            "bodyHinglish": "Barsaat ki ek shaam Padwal Mama ke flat ki balcony mein kapde latke the. Do din se wo geele ke geele the: kameez ki aastin ab bhi nam thi aur tauliye se halki si seelan wali smell aa rahi thi. Bhanja Saurabh chhutti par aaya tha. Usne kapde chhuaye aur munh bana liya, \"Mama, dhoop to kal bhi thi. Phir ye sookhte kyun nahi?\"\n\nAndar TV par mausam ki khabar chal rahi thi: \"Aaj ki hawa mein **RH 84 percent** hai aur **dew point 24 °C**.\" Mama ne remote se awaaz badhayi aur bole, \"Sun, Saurabh: ye do shabd, RH aur dew point, tere sawal ka jawab hain. Hawa ke paas paani rakhne ki ek 'jagah' hoti hai, aur aaj wo lagbhag bhari hui hai. Bhari hui hawa mein geela kapda apna paani kahan rakhega?\"\n\nSaurabh ne bhaunh uthayi, \"To kya hawa 84 percent paani hai?\" Mama hanse, \"Ye bhi ek galti hai. Aaj ke topic mein dono shabdon ka sahi matlab banayenge, aur aakhir mein TV wali in dono sankhyaon se hi hawa ka temperature bhi nikaal lenge.\""
