            "headingHinglish": "Class 9 ka recall",
            "body": "- **Water cycle** (Class 9, [water-part5.md](../../../class9/chemistry/water/water-part5.md)): dhoop se paani evaporate hota hai, oopar jaakar condense hokar baadal banta hai, aur baarish ban kar wapas aata hai.\n- **Latent heat** ([heat-and-temperature-part5.md](../../../class9/physics/heat-and-temperature/heat-and-temperature-part5.md)): state badalte waqt temperature nahi badalta; garmi Q = m L lagti hai. L_f = 3.36 × 10⁵ J/kg aur L_v = 2.26 × 10⁶ J/kg.\n- Wahan water cycle ko \"paani ka chakkar\" ki tarah padha tha. Ab uska **garmi ka khaata** bhi likhenge: har modd par kitni garmi jaati ya aati hai.",
            "bodyHinglish": "- **Water cycle** (Class 9, [water-part5.md](../../../class9/chemistry/water/water-part5.md)): dhoop se paani evaporate hota hai, oopar jaakar condense hokar baadal banta hai, aur baarish ban kar wapas aata hai.\n- **Latent heat** ([heat-and-temperature-part5.md](../../../class9/physics/heat-and-temperature/heat-and-temperature-part5.md)): state badalte waqt temperature nahi badalta; garmi Q = m L lagti hai. L_f = 3.36 × 10⁵ J/kg aur L_v = 2.26 × 10⁶ J/kg.\n- Wahan water cycle ko \"paani ka chakkar\" ki tarah padha tha. Ab uska **garmi ka khaata** bhi likhenge: har modd par kitni garmi jaati ya aati hai."
