            "body": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Nuclear equation** | Ek line jo dikhati hai ki badalne se pehle nucleus kaun-sa tha aur baad mein kaun-kaun se nuclei ya kan bane | U-238 → Th-234 + He-4 |\n| **Parent nucleus** | Wo nucleus jo badalta hai (equation mein teer ke baayein) | U-238 |\n| **Daughter nucleus** | Badalne ke baad bacha naya nucleus (teer ke daayein, kan ke alawa) | Th-234 |\n| **Alpha decay** | Nucleus se ek alpha kan (He-4) nikalna: A mein 4 ki kami, Z mein 2 ki kami | Ra-226 se Rn-222 |\n| **Beta decay** | Nucleus se ek beta kan (electron) nikalna: A wahi, Z mein 1 ki badhat | C-14 se N-14 |\n| **Gamma emission** | Josheele nucleus ka sirf gamma ray ke roop mein energy chhodna: A aur Z, dono wahi | Co-60 ke Ni-60 banne ke baad |\n| **Decay series** | Parent se daughter, daughter se agli daughter, aise kadam-dar-kadam badalna, jab tak ek tikau nucleus na mil jaaye | U-238 se Pb-206 tak ka lamba silsila |",
            "bodyHinglish": "| Shabd | Matlab (simple bhasha mein) | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Nuclear equation** | Ek line jo dikhati hai ki badalne se pehle nucleus kaun-sa tha aur baad mein kaun-kaun se nuclei ya kan bane | U-238 → Th-234 + He-4 |\n| **Parent nucleus** | Wo nucleus jo badalta hai (equation mein teer ke baayein) | U-238 |\n| **Daughter nucleus** | Badalne ke baad bacha naya nucleus (teer ke daayein, kan ke alawa) | Th-234 |\n| **Alpha decay** | Nucleus se ek alpha kan (He-4) nikalna: A mein 4 ki kami, Z mein 2 ki kami | Ra-226 se Rn-222 |\n| **Beta decay** | Nucleus se ek beta kan (electron) nikalna: A wahi, Z mein 1 ki badhat | C-14 se N-14 |\n| **Gamma emission** | Josheele nucleus ka sirf gamma ray ke roop mein energy chhodna: A aur Z, dono wahi | Co-60 ke Ni-60 banne ke baad |\n| **Decay series** | Parent se daughter, daughter se agli daughter, aise kadam-dar-kadam badalna, jab tak ek tikau nucleus na mil jaaye | U-238 se Pb-206 tak ka lamba silsila |"
