            "headingHinglish": "Coin Decay ka khel aur lakdi ki naav",
            "body": "School ke science fair mein \"Coin Decay\" ka stall tha. Mr. Ingale apne bhanje Naveen ko wahan le gaye. Teacher ke saath ek bachchi ne ek badi tray mein 100 sikke daale, tray hilayi, aur phir jin sikkon par **tails** aaya unhe nikaal kar alag rakh diya. Bache hue sikke gine: 52. Phir wahi: sirf bache hue sikke tray mein, tray hilao, tails nikalo. Is baar 24. Naveen ne kaha, \"Mama, har round mein lagbhag aadhe nikal jaate hain!\"\n\n\"Haan,\" Mr. Ingale ne kaha, \"par ye batao, kya tum bata sakte ho ki **kaun sa** sikka agle round mein hatega?\" Naveen ne sir hilaya: \"Nahi, wo to toss par hai.\" \"Bas, yahi random hona hai, aur phir bhi **ginti** ka pattern pakka hai.\"\n\nStall ke baahar ek akhbaar ki cutting lagi thi: nadi ke kinare ki khudai mein mili ek purani lakdi ki naav ki photo, neeche likha: \"Umar lagbhag 11,000 saal se zyada, carbon-14 se tay ki gayi.\" Naveen ne pucha, \"Mama, ye kaise? Kisne naav ke saath janam-tithi likhi thi kya?\" Mr. Ingale hanse: \"Koi tithi nahi likhi thi. Ek 'ghadi' naav ki lakdi ke andar hi chalti hai, wahi sikkon wali ghadi: aadha, phir aadha, phir aadha. Chalo samjhte hain.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "School ke science fair mein \"Coin Decay\" ka stall tha. Mr. Ingale apne bhanje Naveen ko wahan le gaye. Teacher ke saath ek bachchi ne ek badi tray mein 100 sikke daale, tray hilayi, aur phir jin sikkon par **tails** aaya unhe nikaal kar alag rakh diya. Bache hue sikke gine: 52. Phir wahi: sirf bache hue sikke tray mein, tray hilao, tails nikalo. Is baar 24. Naveen ne kaha, \"Mama, har round mein lagbhag aadhe nikal jaate hain!\"\n\n\"Haan,\" Mr. Ingale ne kaha, \"par ye batao, kya tum bata sakte ho ki **kaun sa** sikka agle round mein hatega?\" Naveen ne sir hilaya: \"Nahi, wo to toss par hai.\" \"Bas, yahi random hona hai, aur phir bhi **ginti** ka pattern pakka hai.\"\n\nStall ke baahar ek akhbaar ki cutting lagi thi: nadi ke kinare ki khudai mein mili ek purani lakdi ki naav ki photo, neeche likha: \"Umar lagbhag 11,000 saal se zyada, carbon-14 se tay ki gayi.\" Naveen ne pucha, \"Mama, ye kaise? Kisne naav ke saath janam-tithi likhi thi kya?\" Mr. Ingale hanse: \"Koi tithi nahi likhi thi. Ek 'ghadi' naav ki lakdi ke andar hi chalti hai, wahi sikkon wali ghadi: aadha, phir aadha, phir aadha. Chalo samjhte hain.\""
