            "bodyHinglish": "> **Suraksha:** radioactive padarth hamesha hospital ya prayogshala ke visheshagya sambhalte hain. Hum use **kabhi chhoote, ikattha karte, kholte ya jaanchte nahi.** Peele-kaale **trefoil** (teen patti wale) nishan ka matlab hai: door raho aur kisi bade ko batao. Is topic ki saari activities mein sirf **sikke, beans aur kagaz** hain; kuch bhi radioactive nahi hai. Sikke chhote bachchon ke muh se door rakho (nigalne ka khatra), aur activity **ghar par adult ke saath** ya **school mein teacher ke saath** karo."
