            "body": "Subah Mr. Satpute chai pi rahe the ki unki bhanji Revati akhbaar le kar aayi. Ek lamba lekh tha: Bharat ka nuclear karyakram, \"teen charan\", \"fast breeder\", \"thorium\". Revati boli, \"Mama, ye 'fission' aur 'fusion' mein kya fark hai? Dono ek jaise lagte hain. Aur thorium kya hai, uranium ke saath uska kya lena-dena?\"\n\nMr. Satpute muskuraye: \"Is shanivaar tumhare school ki trip science museum ke atomic energy gallery ja rahi hai na? Main bhi saath chalunga. Wahan ek reactor ka cut-away model hai, aur BARC (Bhabha Atomic Research Centre, Mumbai) ki photo-panel hain. Tab tak ye lekh ek kinare rakho; pehle ye samjho ki ye sab nucleus ke hisaab se kya hai.\"\n\nShanivaar ko gallery mein Revati ne ek badi photo dekhi: ek saumya chehre wale vaigyanik, Dr. Homi Bhabha. Neeche likha tha: \"Bharat ke parmanu karyakram ke sansthapak\". Panel par teen baxe bane the, ek ke baad ek, teer ke saath. \"Mama, ye teen charan kya hain?\" Mr. Satpute ne kaha, \"Bilkul yahi sawaal Part E mein khulega. Pehle fission aur fusion.\"",
            "bodyHinglish": "Subah Mr. Satpute chai pi rahe the ki unki bhanji Revati akhbaar le kar aayi. Ek lamba lekh tha: Bharat ka nuclear karyakram, \"teen charan\", \"fast breeder\", \"thorium\". Revati boli, \"Mama, ye 'fission' aur 'fusion' mein kya fark hai? Dono ek jaise lagte hain. Aur thorium kya hai, uranium ke saath uska kya lena-dena?\"\n\nMr. Satpute muskuraye: \"Is shanivaar tumhare school ki trip science museum ke atomic energy gallery ja rahi hai na? Main bhi saath chalunga. Wahan ek reactor ka cut-away model hai, aur BARC (Bhabha Atomic Research Centre, Mumbai) ki photo-panel hain. Tab tak ye lekh ek kinare rakho; pehle ye samjho ki ye sab nucleus ke hisaab se kya hai.\"\n\nShanivaar ko gallery mein Revati ne ek badi photo dekhi: ek saumya chehre wale vaigyanik, Dr. Homi Bhabha. Neeche likha tha: \"Bharat ke parmanu karyakram ke sansthapak\". Panel par teen baxe bane the, ek ke baad ek, teer ke saath. \"Mama, ye teen charan kya hain?\" Mr. Satpute ne kaha, \"Bilkul yahi sawaal Part E mein khulega. Pehle fission aur fusion.\""
