            "heading": "Part A: Master table: sab ek nazar mein",
            "headingHinglish": "Part A: Master table: sab ek nazar mein",
            "body": "**Alpha, beta aur gamma** (Topic 2 ki table, ek jagah):\n\n| Baat | Alpha (α) | Beta (β) | Gamma (γ) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Kya hai | He-4 nucleus (2 protons + 2 neutrons) | Tez electron | EM wave |\n| Charge | +2e | −e | 0 |\n| Mass | lagbhag 4 u | lagbhag 1/1836 u | 0 |\n| Chaal (lagbhag) | c ka lagbhag 5 percent | c ka 99 percent tak | c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s |\n| Ionising shakti | sabse zyada | beech ki | sabse kam |\n| Rokne wala | kaagaz ya hawa ke kuch cm | aluminium ke kuch mm | moti lead ya concrete (kam hoti hai, shunya nahi) |\n| Field mein | thoda mudta hai | zyada, ulti taraf | seedhi |\n| Nucleus mein badlaav | A − 4, Z − 2 | A wahi, Z + 1 | A aur Z wahi |\n\n**Fission aur fusion** (Topic 5 ka saar):\n\n| Baat | Fission | Fusion |\n|---|---|---|\n| Kya hota hai | Ek bhaari nucleus tootta hai | Do halke nuclei judte hain |\n| Equation (A aur Z jaanch ke saath) | U-235 + n → Ba-141 + Kr-92 + 3 n (A: 236 = 141 + 92 + 3; Z: 92 = 56 + 36) | H-2 + H-3 → He-4 + n (A: 5 = 4 + 1; Z: 2 = 2 + 0) |\n| Energy kahan se | Mass ka thoda sa kam hona, E = mc² | Wahi, E = mc² |\n| Zaroorat | Neutron, aur chain ko control karna | Lagbhag 10⁷ °C ya usse zyada (positive nuclei ek-doosre ko dhakelte hain) |\n| Kahan | Aaj ke nuclear reactor | Sooraj aur taare; dharti par fusion reactor abhi ban rahe hain |\n\n**Upyog aur khatre** (Topic 6 ka saar):\n\n| Kshetra | Upyog (sirf trained log) | Khatra aur bachav |\n|---|---|---|\n| Medicine | Tc-99m se imaging, I-131 thyroid ke liye, Co-60 gamma se ilaaj, instruments ki sterilising | Ionisation cells ko nuksaan pahuncha sakti hai; samay kam, doori zyada, shielding |\n| Industry | Weld ki gamma radiography, beta se thickness gauge, smoke detector ka sealed Am-241 | Detector ko kabhi kholna nahi |\n| Agriculture | Mutation breeding, food irradiation (irradiated food radioactive nahi hota) | Source sirf trained logon ke paas |\n| Archaeology | Carbon dating (C-14, lagbhag 50,000 saal tak) | Jeev se bani cheezon par; natural C-14 ki matra bahut kam |\n| Background | Lagbhag 2 se 3 millisieverts per year, duniya ka average lagbhag 2.4 | Chhoti dose, chhota jokhim; zyada dose se radiation sickness aur cancer ka jokhim |",
            "bodyHinglish": "**Alpha, beta aur gamma** (Topic 2 ki table, ek jagah):\n\n| Baat | Alpha (α) | Beta (β) | Gamma (γ) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Kya hai | He-4 nucleus (2 protons + 2 neutrons) | Tez electron | EM wave |\n| Charge | +2e | −e | 0 |\n| Mass | lagbhag 4 u | lagbhag 1/1836 u | 0 |\n| Chaal (lagbhag) | c ka lagbhag 5 percent | c ka 99 percent tak | c = 3 × 10⁸ m/s |\n| Ionising shakti | sabse zyada | beech ki | sabse kam |\n| Rokne wala | kaagaz ya hawa ke kuch cm | aluminium ke kuch mm | moti lead ya concrete (kam hoti hai, shunya nahi) |\n| Field mein | thoda mudta hai | zyada, ulti taraf | seedhi |\n| Nucleus mein badlaav | A − 4, Z − 2 | A wahi, Z + 1 | A aur Z wahi |\n\n**Fission aur fusion** (Topic 5 ka saar):\n\n| Baat | Fission | Fusion |\n|---|---|---|\n| Kya hota hai | Ek bhaari nucleus tootta hai | Do halke nuclei judte hain |\n| Equation (A aur Z jaanch ke saath) | U-235 + n → Ba-141 + Kr-92 + 3 n (A: 236 = 141 + 92 + 3; Z: 92 = 56 + 36) | H-2 + H-3 → He-4 + n (A: 5 = 4 + 1; Z: 2 = 2 + 0) |\n| Energy kahan se | Mass ka thoda sa kam hona, E = mc² | Wahi, E = mc² |\n| Zaroorat | Neutron, aur chain ko control karna | Lagbhag 10⁷ °C ya usse zyada (positive nuclei ek-doosre ko dhakelte hain) |\n| Kahan | Aaj ke nuclear reactor | Sooraj aur taare; dharti par fusion reactor abhi ban rahe hain |\n\n**Upyog aur khatre** (Topic 6 ka saar):\n\n| Kshetra | Upyog (sirf trained log) | Khatra aur bachav |\n|---|---|---|\n| Medicine | Tc-99m se imaging, I-131 thyroid ke liye, Co-60 gamma se ilaaj, instruments ki sterilising | Ionisation cells ko nuksaan pahuncha sakti hai; samay kam, doori zyada, shielding |\n| Industry | Weld ki gamma radiography, beta se thickness gauge, smoke detector ka sealed Am-241 | Detector ko kabhi kholna nahi |\n| Agriculture | Mutation breeding, food irradiation (irradiated food radioactive nahi hota) | Source sirf trained logon ke paas |\n| Archaeology | Carbon dating (C-14, lagbhag 50,000 saal tak) | Jeev se bani cheezon par; natural C-14 ki matra bahut kam |\n| Background | Lagbhag 2 se 3 millisieverts per year, duniya ka average lagbhag 2.4 | Chhoti dose, chhota jokhim; zyada dose se radiation sickness aur cancer ka jokhim |"
